# ============================================================
# What stays VISIBLE when this repo is pushed as the public
# code repository (referenced in each submission's metadata):
#   README.md, pipeline/ (code, prompts, build spec, uv.lock),
#   pipeline/data/derived/ (small derived calibration targets +
#   retrodiction slice, with extraction scripts), the whitelisted
#   retrodiction provenance files under data/raw/, reference/
#   (outcome priors + pre-analysis notes, cited in registration).
# Everything else is ignored below.
# ============================================================

# --- secrets: never commit ---
.env
*.env

# --- OS / editor / python noise ---
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/

# --- internal working notes (not part of the public submission record) ---
STRATEGY.md
DEPOSIT_CHECKLIST.md

# --- signed declaration (goes in the deposit email, not a public repo) ---
declaration/

# --- the organizers' template copy and the per-entry submission repos
#     (each submission is its own repository + Zenodo deposit) ---
template/
submissions/

# --- elicitation runs & logs (the raw logs backing each entry are already
#     deposited inside that entry's repo under raw_data_deposit/) ---
pipeline/runs/

# --- bulky third-party datasets: excluded wholesale (re-download paths in
#     PROVENANCE.md), except our own small derived artifacts cited in the
#     registration forms (retrodiction ground 1 effects + extraction scripts) ---
pipeline/data/raw/*
!pipeline/data/raw/PROVENANCE.md
!pipeline/data/raw/vlasceanu2024_climate/
pipeline/data/raw/vlasceanu2024_climate/*
!pipeline/data/raw/vlasceanu2024_climate/us_ates.csv
!pipeline/data/raw/vlasceanu2024_climate/compute_us_ates.py
!pipeline/data/raw/vlasceanu2024_climate/extract_us_stimuli.py
